          "content": {
            "size": 36417,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"analytics_id\":\"283d24d98632617f5a68b1b67b3ce4a3\",\"messages\":[[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Hi I made a new thing and am curious if there is any feedback or if people want other versions of it. It's a iso hack for practicing steps or exploring new step routes. Currently it just handles the no slots route. Bosses that aren't pre-emptable have been removed, unecessary inactive step screens have been skipped. Additionally it's all on 'disc 1' so you don't need to change disc.\\nHeres the file: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1oJo8Zx2mj32krIWjJzojuACMjff4lv1w/view\\nHere's a video of it start to finish:\\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EevrIl_bwxI\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"url\":\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1oJo8Zx2mj32krIWjJzojuACMjff4lv1w/view\",\"title\":\"CSR Final Fantasy VII (USA) (Disc 1)62.bin\",\"provider\":{\"name\":\"Google Docs\"},\"content_scan_version\":4},{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EevrIl_bwxI\",\"title\":\"Steps % an FF VII practice tool\",\"color\":16711680,\"author\":{\"name\":\"Hope Productions\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNOO4Px0BQjgzqPD_DJv-kA\"},\"provider\":{\"name\":\"YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EevrIl_bwxI/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/xj_IYfgdF6_5hU7ikEUmmC4TAwJYwZrlbd4cVTYpQVM/https/i.ytimg.com/vi/EevrIl_bwxI/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"width\":1280,\"height\":720,\"content_type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"placeholder\":\"HPgVDIKfZZmteHdWh4qDX0r5pQ==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"video\":{\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EevrIl_bwxI\",\"width\":1280,\"height\":720,\"placeholder\":\"HPgVDIKfZZmteHdWh4qDX0r5pQ==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"content_scan_version\":4}],\"timestamp\":\"2025-05-04T14:50:24.009000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1368600657040380054\",\"channel_id\":\"944817091737964644\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"191046608064872449\",\"username\":\"hopeproductions\",\"avatar\":\"ea6a8fcda648eb65fdae9becbd0c4fe4\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Hope\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"But I can't seem to figure out the memory address for Var[6] which as you mentioned is a temp storage, I'm trying to debug an issue in the CSR where I suspect some hidden variable is being set/not set correctly causing an issue in the NMS route but not in the no slots route.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-12-28T18:05:56.875000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1322626609316102165\",\"channel_id\":\"944817091737964644\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Is there any publicly available version of the beachplug script? I've tried searching but I can only find the output of the script by Dash. Once again it's for CSR so if the actual script is available it might be easier so I can alter it if needs be as the CSR time changes. Thanks\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-29T00:27:53.578000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1311851092967034880\",\"channel_id\":\"944817091737964644\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"There is a channel for the CSR \\ud83c\\udf89\\n\\nhttps://discord.com/channels/936291902133796955/1307919162534006854\\n\\nGo over there to follow the latest discussions.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-19T00:07:01.540000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-19T00:07:24.583000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1308221962883043339\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1377,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":19,\"content\":\"4h20m? Nice <:Kappa:1075235124200886273> we should try make this time the absolute limit of the CSR <:KEKW:1074810897308069948>\",\"mentions\":[{\"id\":\"385844703091884033\",\"username\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar\":\"defa3ccf4c743532ee4492eeeabde14c\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null}],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-18T07:47:17.915000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307975406489567293\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"message_reference\":{\"type\":0,\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"message_id\":\"1307899939581460542\",\"guild_id\":\"936291902133796955\"},\"position\":1371,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I appreciate your perspective Rendall thank you for reviewing the CSR, there are a lot of little things like this throughout the run that we're trying to figure out so keep 'em coming! \\u2764\\ufe0f\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-18T07:45:29.609000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-18T07:45:46.037000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307974952221147166\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1370,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":19,\"content\":\"yeah figured as much, Still feel like some off it could go ! of course I have a very bad opinion of the recording playback to begin with but understand people need time to review the recording , slow it down and load the cheat sheet and fill it in to have a clue and this CSR is for the purpose of any% no slot% currently. I demand a complete CSR ! you runner chasing rng can just adjust w/o the cut scene and use the stair now !  (joking of course) cheers !\",\"mentions\":[{\"id\":\"385844703091884033\",\"username\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar\":\"defa3ccf4c743532ee4492eeeabde14c\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null}],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-18T03:14:06.484000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307906655844962416\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"309356817169776641\",\"username\":\".rendall\",\"avatar\":\"92721b514158fd7d7a9ea5e1768da748\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Rendall\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"message_reference\":{\"type\":0,\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"message_id\":\"1307899743594348625\",\"guild_id\":\"936291902133796955\"},\"position\":1364,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"i finished a run last night (v0.5.3) with a time 4h 20m <:Kappa:1075235124200886273> \\nam writing some of my feedback / comments but i would say generally everything good so far. really great work on this CSR  \\n\\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hszz1VB5ELk\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hszz1VB5ELk\",\"title\":\"FF7 CSR v0.5.3 - No Slots% Digital - 4h 20m 33s\",\"color\":16711680,\"author\":{\"name\":\"Phekwei1200\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjJO-hh-y2EIo4DANk0z3qw\"},\"provider\":{\"name\":\"YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hszz1VB5ELk/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/TpiLJ3hA5139C6ATOnXo20PmUdHZBBLsaypJtSzSiOM/https/i.ytimg.com/vi/hszz1VB5ELk/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"width\":1280,\"height\":720,\"content_type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"placeholder\":\"SPcFHILQcVZ7eHhWeWYvSvdBSg==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"video\":{\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hszz1VB5ELk\",\"width\":1280,\"height\":720,\"placeholder\":\"SPcFHILQcVZ7eHhWeWYvSvdBSg==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"content_scan_version\":4}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-18T02:47:25.202000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307899939581460542\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"385844703091884033\",\"username\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar\":\"defa3ccf4c743532ee4492eeeabde14c\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1363,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I don't run with turbo or anything, but I guess it's up to everyones, it's what a few frames, tho if CSR in itself is a thing and a category im sure not one would care that it is removed ?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T18:29:56.102000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307774743382065243\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"309356817169776641\",\"username\":\".rendall\",\"avatar\":\"92721b514158fd7d7a9ea5e1768da748\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Rendall\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1338,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"## \\ud83c\\udfae Release v0.5.4\\n\\nhttps://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\\n\\n- Trimmed Reno fight even more\\n- Trimmed Barret throwing 1500 gil at Cloud\\n- Reverted most of the Yoshiyuki man in Rocket Town interaction, scroll to see rocket remains\\n\\nNo changes to D2 in this release\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"article\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"title\":\"GitHub - individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR: Final Fantas...\",\"description\":\"Final Fantasy 7 CutScenes Removed. Contribute to individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR development by creating an account on GitHub.\",\"color\":1975079,\"provider\":{\"name\":\"GitHub\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/8d9d30c898fcdb480e01cf46b33c67b14e3a7ab336b95e7a903bc085fa0b788a/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/I9Yz0iVg4-PsomEKYtXHSsOmBSYBG0_F1SQ0ZIuM9fc/https/opengraph.githubassets.com/8d9d30c898fcdb480e01cf46b33c67b14e3a7ab336b95e7a903bc085fa0b788a/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":600,\"content_type\":\"image/png\",\"placeholder\":\"/fcFBIBri8WTl2hceV+zHT/L8Q==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"content_scan_version\":4}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T18:26:37.834000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307773911785672847\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1331,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"https://www.twitch.tv/videos/2279033573?t=01h48m28s\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://www.twitch.tv/videos/2279033573?t=01h48m28s\",\"title\":\"FF9 PC CSR 3:12:22 WR - elruinel on Twitch\",\"description\":\"elruinel went live on Twitch. Catch up on their FINAL FANTASY IX VOD now.\",\"provider\":{\"name\":\"Twitch\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://static-cdn.jtvnw.net/cf_vods/dgeft87wbj63p/f85bd3827385a321e827_elruinel_62660948580_3736816485//thumb/thumb2279033573-640x360.jpg\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/wfmh5p-qA5Ge4U7otpi5sFdS3Do7iUcrnkq5Vm99aYE/https/static-cdn.jtvnw.net/cf_vods/dgeft87wbj63p/f85bd3827385a321e827_elruinel_62660948580_3736816485/thumb/thumb2279033573-640x360.jpg\",\"width\":640,\"height\":360,\"content_type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"placeholder\":\"BQgKBIDwwpZpaXl3iHjQSwO9NQ==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"video\":{\"url\":\"https://player.twitch.tv/?video=2279033573&player=twitter&autoplay=true&parent=meta.tag\",\"width\":640,\"height\":378,\"content_type\":\"text/html\",\"flags\":0},\"content_scan_version\":4}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-17T17:21:00.418000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307757397065863248\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1317,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"for example, NMS routes don't get it. However if it saved time to get it in CSR as opposed to any% then maybe it could lead to alternative routing specific to CSR. \\ud83e\\udd37\\u200d\\u2642\\ufe0f\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-16T22:53:11.786000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307478607417049178\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1272,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"## \\ud83c\\udfae Release v0.5.3 \\nhttps://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\\n\\n- When first entering rocket town the scrolling to view the rocket was removed\\n- Seeing bronco for the first time is sped up\\n- Getting the Yoshiyuki from old man in rocket town is faster\\n- No scroll in Gongaga fro \\\"a ruined reactor\\\" section\\n- Entering temple for the first time, removed entire scene with Aeris running up and back to Cloud, party splits and joins then play resumes\\n- When entinring Temple where Tseng is, added back in 1 text box where Aeris is crying\\n- Added back in 1 text box entering template on the weird field with steps\\n- Added 1 text box back in for Aeris at the fountain after rolling rocks\\n- In temple, first entering cliff with lots of doors, removed text boxes after Aeris asks you a question and joins party again\\n- At Demon's gate Cloud now just runs back as DG is coming out of the wall\\n- Leaving the hut in Gongaga after Temple, added 1 text box\\n- Reactor 5 train added 1 text box for Jessie in 2nd carridge\\n- Removed R word on stairs\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"article\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"title\":\"GitHub - individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR: Final Fantas...\",\"description\":\"Final Fantasy 7 CutScenes Removed. Contribute to individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR development by creating an account on GitHub.\",\"color\":1975079,\"provider\":{\"name\":\"GitHub\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/0fee65b1a5bfbec28767a0d4a4ef92fbf3858c7545332b5f2e3e7802d77af8ab/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/xuWdenxRt7h_bZ3hi2xaPIhH36KHn9BfdHx-1VEYXyI/https/opengraph.githubassets.com/0fee65b1a5bfbec28767a0d4a4ef92fbf3858c7545332b5f2e3e7802d77af8ab/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":600,\"content_type\":\"image/png\",\"placeholder\":\"/fcFBIBri8WTl2hceV+zHT/L8Q==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"content_scan_version\":4}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-16T22:06:27.028000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-16T22:06:47.676000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307466843409223721\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1266,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I have the final list of changes for D1 any% https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/19y6yHtODjS5R-VyvtHUKjAo3FL9Fif56p1REQsUzGWg/edit?usp=sharing \\n\\nI'll be hopefully making these changes tonight then I'll be playing through D2 and D3 using this form to track any new changes https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfcZVrLn6QF7-WJVihUU1IwoTfz8Q3eBKBbDSBJ5ez1Q8nWBA/viewform. \\n\\nLet me know if there is something missing from the this D1 list in any%. NMS and 100% to be done after any% which will be v1.0.0 of the patch.\\n\\n## In the next version\\n\\n- Enter rocket town scroll speed up\\n- Seeing bronco for the first time, speed it up\\n- Speed up getting yoshiyuki from old man in rocket town\\n- a ruined reactor scroll speed up\\n- entering temple for the first time, remove entire scene with Aeris running up and back to C\\n- add back in a text box after tseng gives you the key to the temple\\n- Add back in text box entering template weird field with steps\\n- add text box back in with Aeris at the fountain after rolling rocks\\n- in temple, first entering cliff with doors, remove text boxes after aeris asks you a question\\n- Demon's gate Cloud can just run back as DG is coming out of the wall\\n- leaving hut in gongaga after template 1 text box\\n- Reactor 5 train add in some text boxes\\n- remove R word on stairs\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"url\":\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/19y6yHtODjS5R-VyvtHUKjAo3FL9Fif56p1REQsUzGWg/edit?usp=sharing\",\"title\":\"FF7 CSR Forms\",\"provider\":{\"name\":\"Google Docs\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/docs/AHkbwyIR4SZD5N9vDnQkwNNCkV8L3pPqZ1m-phZH0wqoGTAr4ASFdHjxOTaGFdJAEkeV5AiWhADZkXaNTN4OH-Wybo82eKuZ0ZZMdgm36o8l58yLVdtuXRY=w1200-h630-p\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/GXQSVoIuZVvZtWEM5a2wl8oitxAmUfM5368oWxG-M8A/https/lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/docs/AHkbwyIR4SZD5N9vDnQkwNNCkV8L3pPqZ1m-phZH0wqoGTAr4ASFdHjxOTaGFdJAEkeV5AiWhADZkXaNTN4OH-Wybo82eKuZ0ZZMdgm36o8l58yLVdtuXRY%3Dw1200-h630-p\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":630,\"content_type\":\"image/png\",\"placeholder\":\"/fcBBICQu5qLh3e7SHrAnwv8uQ==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"content_scan_version\":4}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-16T19:17:07.665000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-16T21:59:26.069000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307424231952355402\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1263,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Got the CSR working on my duckstation, gonna test it in the next few days\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-16T15:15:05.392000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1307363321124749412\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"385844703091884033\",\"username\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar\":\"defa3ccf4c743532ee4492eeeabde14c\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"phek1200\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1261,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"## \\ud83c\\udfae Release v0.5.2 \\nhttps://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\\n\\n- Lots of small mashing/turbo 1 text boxes added back in, removed, or moved\\n- Don's basement sped up a bit\\n- Batteries shop trimmed\\n- Keycard in Shinra building trimmed\\n- Mayor's password trimmed\\n- Seeing Jenova in Shinra building sections sped up\\n- Bottomswell fight trimmed\\n- Arriving at Costa off the boat, cue for options restored\\n- Barret's house in Corel Prison cues fixed\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"article\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"title\":\"GitHub - individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR: Final Fantas...\",\"description\":\"Final Fantasy 7 CutScenes Removed. Contribute to individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR development by creating an account on GitHub.\",\"color\":1975079,\"provider\":{\"name\":\"GitHub\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/0fee65b1a5bfbec28767a0d4a4ef92fbf3858c7545332b5f2e3e7802d77af8ab/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/xuWdenxRt7h_bZ3hi2xaPIhH36KHn9BfdHx-1VEYXyI/https/opengraph.githubassets.com/0fee65b1a5bfbec28767a0d4a4ef92fbf3858c7545332b5f2e3e7802d77af8ab/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":600,\"content_type\":\"image/png\",\"placeholder\":\"/fcFBIBri8WTl2hceV+zHT/L8Q==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"content_scan_version\":4}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-14T22:43:55.560000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-16T22:06:56.245000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1306751498704916580\",\"channel