creating an account on GitHub.\",\"color\":1975079,\"provider\":{\"name\":\"GitHub\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/616b9f0bbb12f89db13622a7600bf98cd30caccf8e1d4c98b43582a971d4cfc3/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/FiaHMuLSZzYSLlXFTLs0IHNx8IwtvRa6LiUK5iey6Jw/https/opengraph.githubassets.com/616b9f0bbb12f89db13622a7600bf98cd30caccf8e1d4c98b43582a971d4cfc3/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":600,\"content_type\":\"image/png\",\"placeholder\":\"/fcFBIBri8WTl2hceV+zHT/L8Q==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"content_scan_version\":4}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-12T18:46:45.727000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-12T19:19:49.488000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1305967038728110121\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1136,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"<@248225699909861376>  Saw you ran the CSR today, how are the state of things in general. Also was it PSX or Emu I did not catch that info.\",\"mentions\":[{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null}],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-12T17:09:59.734000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1305942686628577352\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"309356817169776641\",\"username\":\".rendall\",\"avatar\":\"92721b514158fd7d7a9ea5e1768da748\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Rendall\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1125,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"that said I just think its funny and you can jump from kneeling at the guy who falls over to prison and its better for a csr\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-11T23:12:12.182000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1305671451256557648\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"191046608064872449\",\"username\":\"hopeproductions\",\"avatar\":\"ea6a8fcda648eb65fdae9becbd0c4fe4\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Hope\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1102,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I had \\\"Tifa turns -> 1 text box -> 2nd option\\\" but it happens super quickly in CSR\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-11T22:38:14.132000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1305662903055155210\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1071,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Quick update on the FF7 CSR that is currently being made, the latest release is out and you can get the patches here https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR, we're nearly finished with Disc 1, and Disc 2 has already got some significant changes. Disc 3 will be trimmed but not until Disc 2 is finished. \\n\\nAlso this is the thread where we are discussing changes and bugs https://discord.com/channels/936291902133796955/1288235003901120586/1305226142231433256\\n\\nMessage me for more detail.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-10T17:49:28.043000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-10T17:50:27.194000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1305227844305162434\",\"channel_id\":\"944817091737964644\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"\\ud83c\\udfae Release v0.4.11 https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\\n\\n- Removed the Junon to Jenova boat World Map scene again\\n- Removed the slow scroll when you first get to the Shinra building\\n- Top of Wall Market first visit talking to the doorman, 1 text box added back when talking to Aeris\\n- Sped up handing over the energy drink in wall market\\n- Added 1 text box before Cid raises hand in the Hotel Lobby for Golden Saucer keystone visit, some runners use Cid as the queue instead of Barret raising his two hands for the option choice\\n- In Junon after the Dolphin, added back in Cloud shrug when talking to the leader about getting dressed\\n- Trimmed after Rufus mood mini-game at Junon a bit more \\n\\nNo changes to Disc 2 or 3 in this release. I also burned this one to disc and tested starting a new game and also the Disc 1 to Disc 2 disc swap after JenovaLife fight, both working as expected. I'll be playing through this patch on disc before making anymore changes, and I'll take some notes for a final trim while I'm doing it. Let me know if you have any further suggestions for changes to disc 1 because I'll be moving onto further trimming disc 2 very soon.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"article\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"title\":\"GitHub - individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR: Final Fantas...\",\"description\":\"Final Fantasy 7 CutScenes Removed. Contribute to individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR development by creating an account on GitHub.\",\"color\":1975079,\"provider\":{\"name\":\"GitHub\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/616b9f0bbb12f89db13622a7600bf98cd30caccf8e1d4c98b43582a971d4cfc3/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/FiaHMuLSZzYSLlXFTLs0IHNx8IwtvRa6LiUK5iey6Jw/https/opengraph.githubassets.com/616b9f0bbb12f89db13622a7600bf98cd30caccf8e1d4c98b43582a971d4cfc3/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":600,\"content_type\":\"image/png\",\"placeholder\":\"/fcFBIBri8WTl2hceV+zHT/L8Q==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"content_scan_version\":4}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-10T17:42:42.237000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-10T17:47:44.294000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1305226142231433256\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1054,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I've made a change to the repo so there is only one available version which is the latest, each patch will be versioned and stored in the git version history so no need for a folder system for version numbers. Debugging that disc swap issue showed that having all the versions in there own folder was useless because I just eneded up using the commit hash, which was better and more of a fine grained way to identify changes to the patches. \\n\\nhttps://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-10T14:34:27.383000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-10T14:35:31.881000+00:00\",\"flags\":4,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1305178768179990528\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1052,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"---\\n\\n\\ud83c\\udfae Release v0.4.010 https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\\n\\n- Fixed the Disc 1 to Disc 2 swapping issue. After the JenovaLife fight disc 2 would not load correctly, this patch fixes this issue by making a change to the blackbgb_103 script to revert some changes made after Motorball\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"article\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"title\":\"GitHub - individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR: Final Fantas...\",\"description\":\"Final Fantasy 7 CutScenes Removed. Contribute to individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR development by creating an account on GitHub.\",\"color\":1975079,\"provider\":{\"name\":\"GitHub\"},\"content_scan_version\":4}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-10T01:00:59.852000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-10T14:33:44.127000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304974054557745295\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1049,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"The thing is I load a non-CSR save file straight into the JenovaLife area, then play from there\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-10T00:34:09.895000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304967301908664350\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":1015,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"in the csr\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T23:42:33.993000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304954316754391063\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"191046608064872449\",\"username\":\"hopeproductions\",\"avatar\":\"ea6a8fcda648eb65fdae9becbd0c4fe4\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":512,\"flags\":512,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Hope\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":991,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Moved to here because of character limit:\\n\\nFor the binary search range I'll use the commit hashes in the repo, the dates of commits, and a rough estimate of the middle given the number of commits, the initial range is:\\n\\nhttps://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/commits/main/?before=a131f848142391ef38630fc89c3e6b6c84cd7c44+35\\n\\n- 65dbdbb (initial commit, Oct 5th, '24) - D1 > D2 disc swap works as expected \\u2705 \\n\\n- 6b20e5a (new update, Oct 12th, '24) - D1 > D2 disc swap works as expected \\u2705 \\n\\n- 5129385 (sleep music back in for 7th Heaven, Oct 13th, '24) - D1 > D2 disc swap works as expected \\u2705 \\n\\n- e433176 (reduced after jenova dialogues, Oct 14th, '24) - D1 > D2 disc swap works as expected \\u2705 \\n\\n// no more versions in here to test\\n\\n**- 6bf4c1b (reduced rufus and after motorball scenes, Oct 14th, '24) - D1 > D2 disc swap not working \\u274c**\\n- 783be7d (dyne..., Oct 15th, '24) - D1 > D2 disc swap not working \\u274c\\n\\n- 43b4b0e (v0.1.1, Oct 24th, '24) - D1 > D2 disc swap not working \\u274c\\n\\n---\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T22:47:53.248000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T23:59:45.534000+00:00\",\"flags\":4,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304940556312379492\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":969,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"These are the versions left to test:\\n\\n\\n**Oct 13th, '24**\\nhttps://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/commits/main/?after=a131f848142391ef38630fc89c3e6b6c84cd7c44+34\\n\\n4946a25d49a2d5516a518d6bd58f373003f26087 new updates for junon\\n\\n588a8c5eff40c9bcd59a06e85cc6a46fb3fac1be moved part where you name Aeris in any%\\n\\n3119511f0fb2adebaa601f69e3c565895abfaf74 updates to shinra building and prisons\\n\\n51293858fbe23cc8a27f3cd6b2d921d65a3993bd added the sleep music back in for 7th heaven and prisons\\n\\n**Oct 14th, '24**\\n\\nhttps://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/commits/main/?before=a131f848142391ef38630fc89c3e6b6c84cd7c44+35\\n\\n51653270222384e3dd132aade02d8872ab87583b fixed a bug at jenova on the boat\\n\\ne433176b2728b80242468c6497185eed4bd377df reduced after jenova dialogues\\n\\n6bf4c1bb4e730cc97ff1678846e5ab5d2990f155 reduced rufus and after motorball scenes\\n\\n**Oct 15th, '24**\\n\\nhttps://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/commits/main/?before=a131f848142391ef38630fc89c3e6b6c84cd7c44+35\\n\\n7e3097f71627a7b62e789930c8ed9953761d3955 from jenny on the block until dyne reviewed and shortened\\n\\n\\nAnd next one I'm testing is the middle of these, so **51293858fbe23cc8a27f3cd6b2d921d65a3993bd added the sleep music back in for 7th heaven and prisons**, put your bets in now! Pass \\u2705  or Fail \\u274c  <:KEKW:1074810897308069948>\\n\\nCurrent result set https://discord.com/channels/936291902133796955/1288235003901120586/1304940556312379492\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T22:30:53.829000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-09T22:48:38.386000+00:00\",\"flags\":4,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304936280559194194\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":968,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"This is the list I'm working from https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/commits/main\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"article\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/commits/main\",\"title\":\"Commits \\u00b7 individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"description\":\"Final Fantasy 7 CutScenes Removed. Contribute to individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR development by creatin