            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"analytics_id\":\"09a8e75168933b40b3e2761e3c130852\",\"messages\":[[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"ChatGPT FTW\\n\\nPOPS (PopStation Emulator)\\nPOPS stands for PlayStation Operating System, and it's the name of the software emulator that the PS2 uses when running PS1 games from other sources, like burned discs, or digital versions of PS1 games stored on a memory card or external storage.\\n\\nSo this tells me that the burned CSR discs are running on Pops?\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T22:12:11.710000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T22:12:37.216000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304206798319779962\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":601,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"OPL Pop is actually what I use currently when I'm dabbling with FF9 CSR, don't wanna wear my laser out just to enable me to play a game badly\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T21:30:44.478000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304196366112657470\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":596,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"\\ud83c\\udfae Release v0.4.9 https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/tree/main/v0.4.9\\n\\n- Fixes that softlock above <:KEKW:1074810897308069948>\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"article\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/tree/main/v0.4.9\",\"title\":\"Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/v0.4.9 at main \\u00b7 individualcontributordev/Final...\",\"description\":\"Final Fantasy 7 CutScenes Removed. Contribute to individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR development by creating an account on GitHub.\",\"color\":1975079,\"provider\":{\"name\":\"GitHub\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/9ec20b5a7c9ea0152d56571baded620f3ea92731b443aeebdc8b22e07a022725/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/3krDLeU1p1uHkgtvsw3Pc_um5kqDa_ry8hmFzfAc568/https/opengraph.githubassets.com/9ec20b5a7c9ea0152d56571baded620f3ea92731b443aeebdc8b22e07a022725/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":600,\"content_type\":\"image/png\",\"placeholder\":\"/fcFBIBri8WTl2hceV+zHT/L8Q==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"content_scan_version\":2}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T18:37:39.467000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T18:37:56.156000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304152808219475969\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":579,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Just thought I'd give the CSR a look and this happened? Is this known about?\\nI was grabbing a potion off the red dude and now I'm softlocked lol\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"1304110160201125938\",\"filename\":\"image.png\",\"size\":601293,\"url\":\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1288235003901120586/1304110160201125938/image.png?ex=6a6e153b&is=6a6cc3bb&hm=88a7bfc494f3ff212fe30c86dd22177ea833c4dde5254223bd229b7e52074c7e&\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1288235003901120586/1304110160201125938/image.png?ex=6a6e153b&is=6a6cc3bb&hm=88a7bfc494f3ff212fe30c86dd22177ea833c4dde5254223bd229b7e52074c7e&\",\"width\":760,\"height\":591,\"content_type\":\"image/png\",\"placeholder\":\"jAgGDYKf/K3Mx5yGa3aGh6+r+Jd7\",\"placeholder_version\":1}],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T15:48:11.432000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304110160389603449\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"521419888959684659\",\"username\":\"themattdavis\",\"avatar\":\"eb32f76a4d1ca6ec80fa329bf17c8fab\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"TMD\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":574,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"\\ud83c\\udfae Release v0.4.8 https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/tree/main/v0.4.8\\n\\n- Fixed error in Emu console which may be causing the Disc 2 loading issues after the Break Scene, testing on PSX disc needed to verify\\n- Restored scene where Cloud is carrying Aeris in the water (Aeris dying is a big deal so an extra ~10 seconds of a cutscene is worth it I think)\\n- Trimmed Rocket town first visit a bit more\\n- Fixed \\\"Shake it\\\" scene after Red Dragon\\n- Trimmed Gold Saucer date scenes and hotel lobby a bit more\\n- Fixed Junon down right scene missing and restored the command game tutorial section with text box queues (this whole section felt a bit weird after trimming so I started again and trimmed a tiny bit, can be reviewed)\\n\\nNo Disc 2 changes in this release\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"article\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/tree/main/v0.4.8\",\"title\":\"Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/v0.4.8 at main \\u00b7 individualcontributordev/Final...\",\"description\":\"Final Fantasy 7 CutScenes Removed. Contribute to individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR development by creating an account on GitHub.\",\"color\":1975079,\"provider\":{\"name\":\"GitHub\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/0467369a16c89150e18ba50245963e887e779ca8c682fcee9ce72fe4f74d4698/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/ICDHH1Vho5ysSxdq9HtPP77GNWQGK95e5ZrDyP9nDIY/https/opengraph.githubassets.com/0467369a16c89150e18ba50245963e887e779ca8c682fcee9ce72fe4f74d4698/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":600,\"content_type\":\"image/png\",\"placeholder\":\"/fcFBIBri8WTl2hceV+zHT/L8Q==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"content_scan_version\":3}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T09:21:16.982000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T13:08:39.391000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1304012791929372676\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":569,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"yep I agree having D1 done also means I can play the god damn CSR\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-07T01:03:29.687000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303887519414358036\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":543,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"CSR is so easy to say 'this is wrong', 'this scene could be changed' etc\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T17:23:54.582000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303771861041287289\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"248225699909861376\",\"username\":\"awesomewaves\",\"avatar\":\"7de794a8a3e242252076a10784af0a9f\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"awesomeWaves\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":454,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"I'll be real, I dont think oceanfly(or whatever its called now) really warrants a break on csr\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T17:19:50.148000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303770835810652322\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"289891674660929538\",\"username\":\"teeejj0102\",\"avatar\":\"aabd4c1026f28787683c2de660f2aa57\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Teeejj\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":{\"font_id\":8,\"effect_id\":1,\"colors\":[]},\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":441,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Release v0.4.7 https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/tree/main/v0.4.7\\n\\n- Moved the break scene to before the spiral hut scene to test a bug fix on PSX where Disc 2 wouldn't load correctly after putting it into the console. Suspected issue with the music still playing from the break scene when disc is being changed. Not an issue on Emulator. \\n- Trimmed Reno text box\\n- Trimmed Slap skip (2 frame time save if you're lucky)\\n- Updates to Jessie skip\\n- Reverted Honey Bee Inn fat guy text boxes because they felt weird\\n\\nIMPORTANT: there may still be a bug on PSX only, at the end of disc 1, maybe related to the break scene, where disc 2 won't load when you insert it. I've moved the break scene further back away from the \\\"Save game\\\" scene before disc swap but haven't tested it on PSX yet. Emulator does not have the same issue.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"article\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/tree/main/v0.4.7\",\"title\":\"Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/v0.4.7 at main \\u00b7 individualcontributordev/Final...\",\"description\":\"Final Fantasy 7 CutScenes Removed. Contribute to individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR development by creating an account on GitHub.\",\"color\":1975079,\"provider\":{\"name\":\"GitHub\"},\"content_scan_version\":4}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T01:10:05.301000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-06T09:51:01.209000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303526790874005525\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"183261151746850816\",\"username\":\"individualcontributor\",\"avatar\":\"b7271f16ff804f9fa069bba774b3d0e7\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"IndividualContributor\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":398,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"FF9 was the same for CSR, some extra backend code or w/e had to be removed for it to not crash going into BW3 on PS2 where on emu it had no issue at all\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-05T01:26:51.018000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-11-05T03:00:41.720000+00:00\",\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303168621291503690\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":348,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"It's important to note that Hope's 0.4 version of CSR on PS2 would crash at the end of lifestream unless you swap in an official disc before you run up to enter the top part of the hub\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-05T00:53:47.462000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303160301654507642\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":345,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"One thing to note though is that I did load up a backup memory card save at DG in my \\\"run\\\" a couple of days back. I doubt that would cause the CSR to not crash on the timer running out though\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-05T00:50:42.621000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":null,\"flags\":0,\"components\":[],\"id\":\"1303159526375030854\",\"channel_id\":\"1288235003901120586\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"170713534726930432\",\"username\":\".okamikaze\",\"avatar\":\"95b696448d658de94544ca767feb61f0\",\"discriminator\":\"0\",\"public_flags\":0,\"flags\":0,\"banner\":null,\"accent_color\":null,\"global_name\":\"Okamikaze\",\"avatar_decoration_data\":null,\"collectibles\":null,\"display_name_styles\":null,\"banner_color\":null,\"clan\":null,\"primary_guild\":null},\"pinned\":false,\"mention_everyone\":false,\"tts\":false,\"position\":343,\"hit\":true}],[{\"type\":0,\"content\":\"Release v0.4.6 https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/tree/main/latest%20v0.4.6\\n\\n- Lots of new trimming from Start to Don's\\n- Trimmed Reactor 5 and Airbuster for the NMS crew\\n- More trimming of JDeath to before Mideel and Cloud's Dream\\n\\nThis version trims almost all text boxes and some animations that were previously untouched in the sections mentioned above. I'm not sure about this approach and would love if you could play it and let me know how it feels. For example, previously I left in some text boxes to make sense of the trimmed sections but now it's just alot of movement with no text boxes. I did leave in 1 or 2 that I thought were warranted.\\n\\nAlso there are a significant number of changes in this version so I'm sorry if I have borked something, please don't burn this to disc until you've played on emulator at least until after Don's, preferably a full run. Having a full run verified as stable would be great, I'll be doing it myself this week regardless.\",\"mentions\":[],\"mention_roles\":[],\"attachments\":[],\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"article\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/tree/main/latest%20v0.4.6\",\"title\":\"Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/latest v0.4.6 at main \\u00b7 individualcontributorde...\",\"description\":\"Final Fantasy 7 CutScenes Removed. Contribute to individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR development by creating an account on GitHub.\",\"color\":1975079,\"provider\":{\"name\":\"GitHub\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/46d60d22b4738ee061913d968b63415cc0a5ce3d005b729c4d3af4fcee6bd783/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"proxy_url\":\"https://images-ext-1.discordapp.net/external/zoQbZvwLRFgoQAqZR3AHbVMf9Og-1IO6lvvKHMnWjm0/https/opengraph.githubassets.com/46d60d22b4738ee061913d968b63415cc0a5ce3d005b729c4d3af4fcee6bd783/individualcontributordev/Final-Fantasy-7-CSR\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":600,\"content_type\":\"image/png\",\"placeholder\":\"/fcFBIBri8WTl2hceV+zHT/L8Q==\",\"placeholder_version\":1,\"flags\":0},\"content_scan_version\":4}],\"timestamp\":\"2024-11-02T23:24:26.218000+00:00\",\"edited_timestamp\":\"2024-